---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Comparative Study">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Comparative Study</h1>
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Comparative Study</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="content">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Comparative and Analytical Study of Best Practices</h2>
      <p>
        This study provides a comprehensive comparative analysis of best practices for the national
        enforcement of ESCP (European Small Claims Procedure) and EOP (European Order for Payment)
        judgments across EU Member States.
      </p>

      <h2>Key Findings</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Analysis of digitalization levels across Member States</li>
        <li>Identification of best practices in enforcement procedures</li>
        <li>Recommendations for improving cross-border enforcement</li>
        <li>Challenges and opportunities in digital transformation</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Structure of the Study</h2>
      <p>The study is organized into the following sections:</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Introduction:</strong> Overview of ESCP and EOP procedures</li>
        <li><strong>Methodology:</strong> Research approach and data collection</li>
        <li><strong>National Reports:</strong> Country-by-country analysis</li>
        <li><strong>Comparative Analysis:</strong> Cross-country comparison</li>
        <li><strong>Best Practices:</strong> Identified best practices</li>
        <li><strong>Recommendations:</strong> Policy recommendations</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Download</h2>
      <p>
        The full study is available for download from the SCAN2 Platform.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://portal.scan2.vub.be" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Access SCAN2 Platform
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
